            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiboi Amasia erwosit a Yudaya ŋolo arae lokoku a Yoas ŋikaru ŋitomon ka ŋikan ketwana Yeoas erwosit a Isirael ŋolo arae lokoku a Yeowas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋiticisyo ka Amasia ŋuluce daadaŋ ageun a ŋulu esyakinak tari ŋulu esidyok, igiritae lokitaabo ŋolo a ŋakiro a ŋirwosi a Yudaya ka Isirael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akisyakin apaki ŋina aŋeryo Amasia akiwuap ŋakiro ke Ekapolon, apotu ŋituŋa a Yerusalem totukut akiar Amasia. Nai abu iŋes tosi, tolot lotaun Lakis. Nai apotu ŋimoe keŋ kiwuapasi iŋes inaa, toara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiwokunae akuwan keŋ a ŋaŋolei tari Yerusalem, tonukae neni anukitae atapapaa keŋ alotaun a Daudi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.28",
